      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.43,
      "end_seconds": 266.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably possible sepsis needing urgent treatment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.55,
      "end_seconds": 306.99,
      "duration_seconds": 24.44,
      "text": "I'll request blood cultures, it'll help with fever with low blood pressure i want to admit you to hospital now for fluids and antibiotics do get help quickly if you cannot be brought in today we'll catch up straight away right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
